  "name": "Chewy Coconut Bars",
  "subtitle": "Soft brown sugar bars with chocolate, walnuts, and coconut",
  "description": "A chewy, tender bar dessert combining brown sugar, chocolate chips, walnuts, and shredded coconut.",
